ing. Please fix the Fill function it doesn't stretch the image , dont chnage anything. But can you have a separate photo media fit for mobile and leave the existing one for desktop?, great. everything is perfect. Don't chnage anything. Fix the media fit for mobile so the image fits inside the box full size. Cover and fill do not work as they should thanks, media fit for mobile does not work correct. The cover setting makes the image too large and the Fill function stretches the image , Great. Don't change anything. add background color for padding around images on mobile and desktop. , great. Don't change anything. Add mobile height control for the featured box., great. Don't change anything. The mobile featured box height does not work, great. Don't change anything. Please fix the Featured box (mobile) to chnage the height. , Great. Don't change anything. The Featured box (mobile) is still not working. Coult you add a portrait layout or different function to make it taller? 
